  "sufficient_criterion": "For a polynomial map with unit Jacobian,coordinate-constancy of S(Phi)-S-log(j/j(0)) suffices for full Wick-functional preservation without a polynomial inverse. Normalized IBP uniqueness proves it. Necessity without inverse is not claimed. Pullback is an injective algebra homomorphism,not necessarily an injective point map.",
  "universal_lift": "For normalized KellerF in n variables,scaling familyF_t=t^-1F(tx),A_t=J_xF_t gives H_F=(F_t,A_t^-T y,t,z+(partial_tF_t)^T A_t^-T y) in2n+2 variables. It has determinant1,preservesx.y+tz,and preserves all split Gaussian moments. H_F is polynomially invertible iffF is;collisions and generic field degree transfer. Polynomiality and weighted Euler/block proofs are universal over Q-algebras.",
  "six_dimensional_application": "Existing weighted foundational cotangent map,after output normalization to weights(1,-1,-2),preserves a nondegenerate quadratic and hence every Gaussian polynomial moment,with an exact rational triple collision and no polynomial inverse. A fixed Q(i)-linear covariance conjugation gives ordinary independent variance-one six-variable Gaussian moments. Map/collision/cotangent/moment-map structures are credited prior work;the full Wick implication is separately proved. Not a new scalar GMC witness or real probability bijection.",
  "transfer_boundary": "Pure sequences and literal ordinary pure ideals transfer exactly through any moment-preserving map;fixed failures pull back,and safety of the source pullback reflects to the target. A source cutoffC gives a target cutoffC*degPhi. Target safety against all source multipliers requires an additional argument without inverse. The cubic field94 pure gate transfers without proving mixed safety.",
